WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.370
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:04.140
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.380
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.930
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:10.640
We've finally found Ikuto!

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.980
All your efforts really paid off, Yoru!

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.460
At last, we can breathe a sigh of relief.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.610
But wait... Isn't Ikuto acting kind of weird?

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.280
You're quite correct!

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:23.520
Stayed tuned to find out what happens next!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.660
Doki!

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:43.180
If you were to walk so the wind fluttered the edge of your cape,

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:49.570
people would look up at you in quiet admiration.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:56.870
You can say spicy things like "it's not my style," if you want,

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:03.290
but I know who you really are because I'm your friend!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.160
Stand! Bow!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.690
Nice and orderly now!

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:10.530
And once that's done,

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:15.800
it's time to start the school day.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:23.420
I like Mondays because I can see all my friends.

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:29.820
There's nothing wrong with being abnormally happy.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:36.990
At lunch break, we have tea in the Royal Garden,

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:44.330
where I tell you all my secrets!

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:07.510
This is the brand new device we've developed for capturing the Embryo.

00:02:07.510 --> 00:02:09.770
We call it the Embryo Catcher.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.230
Right, so, how exactly will it accomplish this?

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:14.690
Allow me to show you.

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:18.270
First, it senses the energy when the Embryo appears.

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:22.320
Then, if it seems to be fleeing, it automatically gives chase to prevent its escape.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.370
Interesting.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:27.540
What's Ikuto doing?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:31.740
We've bolstered our ability to control him with the tuning fork considerably.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.370
We won't permit any further failures.

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:40.710
He'll concentrate solely on playing the violin and collecting many X Eggs.

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.510
Excellent.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:54.610
A puppet has no need for a heart, after all.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:59.570
Episode 96
Unheard Pleas, Shattered Feelings!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:03.910
Shoppin', shoppin'!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.030
We're all...

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:06.180
...having fun...

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.890
...shopping!

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.430
We're just doing a supermarket run, though.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.030
Ami!

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.140
That boy...

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.860
I know him.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.020
Hello!

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.010
We meet again.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.470
Who's dat?

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:50.460
Um... Oh yeah, I don't know his name.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.790
Hi! What's your name?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.840
Are you in ewamentawy school?

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.040
Ami's gonna dance!

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:15.060
What's all the fuss about?

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:18.120
It's not a fuss; they're having fun.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:21.580
Listen, isn't hearing a bright, happy tune super fun?

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.680
Wait up, Ami-chan!

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.550
What's the matter, Amu-chan?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.790
Just thinking that he's a pretty odd kid...

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.380
Yeah, I wonder where he's from.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:46.680
Amu-chan!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.750
Ikuto?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.130
The new artist garnering mass attention.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:55.850
Presenting, DL!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.360
Amu-chan...

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:09.420
I saw this poster, too!

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.840
It says DL, but...

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:13.300
There can be no mistake.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.810
That's Ikuto-nya!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.380
I'm sure of it!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.620
A classical music concert for parents and kids.

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:22.550
Produced by Easter...

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:28.050
Oh man! They're gonna use Ikuto to get a bunch of X Eggs again.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.490
But something's not right.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:35.630
We'd obviously realize that this "DL" person is Tsukiyomi Ikuto when we saw this.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:39.740
They should expect us to show up and try to stop them.

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:42.110
How can they be so bold?

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:46.340
It's almost like they're inviting us to interfere.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.500
This must be a trap.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.400
Tadase, it would be best not to make any hasty moves.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.190
I'm gonna go-nya!

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:53.870
Yoru...

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:59.700
If it means I can see Ikuto, I'll march right into any trap-nya!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:06.060
Right on! A Guardian Character's bearer is their soul mate, you know?

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.490
And you've been searching for Ikuto for oh-so-long!

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:11.530
Through rain and wind...

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:14.070
...you cried out your love.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.600
You guys...

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:20.590
Let's go. Trap or not, we can't just ignore it.

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:21.940
Right.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:29.100
We'll protect everyone's hearts' eggs, no matter what Tsukiyomi Ikuto does or what happens.

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:32.030
That's the duty of Yaya and the Guardians!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:32.960
Yeah.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.350
Ikuto... I'll see you soon-nya.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.010
So?

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:57.770
We've maxed out the levels and everything remains stable.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:04.020
By controlling him this completely, Ikuto-kun's consciousness won't so much as stir.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.400
Nothing <i>seems</i> out of place...

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.830
Don't let your guard down-dechu! We're dealing with Easter here-dechu!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.010
Got that right!

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:19.130
Let's split up and gather information, just like we planned.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:22.750
We'll find out where DL is and stop his performance!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.260
And then, we'll save Ikuto-nya!

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:25.790
Yeah!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:28.590
Ikuto, just hang on.

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.360
Begin the operation.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.590
Yeah!

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:37.350
The Guardians have appeared.

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.490
Perfect.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.480
What should we do?

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:45.560
Ignore them. Let the children play their little game.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:51.460
However, if they try to contact Ikuto before show time, separate them.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.310
Understood.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.880
Hinamori Amu...

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:12.050
You are just another pawn in my quest to capture the Embryo.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.310
Where's DL?

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.510
Can't say.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:24.690
Why not?

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:28.620
Just can't. Besides, DL has unusually tight security.

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:32.400
Only a select few of the staff can get near him.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.520
Now, this is a problem.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.900
Asking something like that out of the blue...

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.240
What's the matter?

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:40.330
What are you doing?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:46.360
I was hoping to get an interview with Mr. DL for my school newspaper.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:50.880
But that's... not happening, huh?

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:54.170
Excuse me!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.830
You're staff, right?

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:01.370
We have a question about DL, who is performing here today.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:05.670
C-Can't help ya! We're not in charge of that.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.440
I see.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:08.830
Let's ask someone else.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:09.440
Yeah.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.280
Chief?

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.800
What happened?

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:23.200
Nothing! Anyway, how's Ikuto doing?

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:46.040
Back to work!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:46.940
Hey...

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:49.050
Let no one inside.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:49.830
Yes.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.630
He's under pretty tight guard, it's true.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:57.610
And the staff are completely clueless.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:01.040
I guess we have no choice but to sneak backstage.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.360
It will be dangerous, but-

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:04.980
If we're gonna save Ikuto, it's our only option-nya!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:07.170
But how will we do that?

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:09.750
I've got a great idea-dechu.

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:13.780
You want to perform?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.300
We're an elementary school song and dance troupe!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.510
T-That's right...

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.180
Hey, weren't you here earlier?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.480
Um...

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.390
I want to perform! I want to perform!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.890
We also do comedy.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.210
We're gonna perform right now!

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:32.480
But this is a classical music concert...

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.480
They're in.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:40.810
Yoru!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.120
Ikuto, where are you-nya?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.560
It's Easter's goons-nya!

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.420
Yoru!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.860
Pipe down-nya!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:01.900
DL... I mean... Ikuto must be in that room.

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:04.340
But how will we get inside?

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.140
Sorry about this!

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.990
Get a move on, people!

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:35.900
Let's go!

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:36.250
Right!

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:45.990
Ikuto!

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.320
Ikuto...

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:04.960
Ikuto...

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.850
Ikuto!

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:09.170
I've finally found you-nya!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:11.370
Come on, let's get out of here-nya!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.380
Ikuto?

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:21.010
Unauthorized personnel are forbidden from entering this room.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.690
Ikuto, what's the matter-nya?

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.410
Stop kidding around-nya.

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:31.730
I bet you're just shocked to see me-nya.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.310
Have you truly forgotten everything?

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:45.760
Yoru, Amu-chan, and even me?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:51.470
You never answered my question. What happened back then?

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:54.830
Why did you steal my key and vanish?

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.350
Tadase-kun...

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:09.300
What are you two doing here?

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.810
Get out, now!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.230
Ikuto!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.070
Ikuto!

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:17.210
Go quietly now!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.450
So then...

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:24.740
We weren't able to talk to him.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:29.470
Ikuto refused to even look at me-nya...

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.410
Has he really forgotten everything?

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:37.570
To be forgotten by your own bearer... How devastating...

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:42.840
It's almost curtain time. We must ensure that everyone's hearts' eggs are safe.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.620
That's all we can do right now.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.970
This concert's gonna be a blast!

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.180
Director!

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.080
How's it going?

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:26.220
Everything's going according to plan.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:30.840
All that's left is to extract all the X Eggs from the children's hearts. Then...

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.100
Why is he here?

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:38.790
Wait, this might actually be convenient.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.240
It's time.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:53.370
And now please welcome our final performer, an up-and-coming violinist, DL.

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.040
Begin.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.060
It's happening!

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:42.790
Everyone!

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:43.960
Right!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:53.550
My heart:

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:55.220
Unlock!

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:23.920
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:28.130
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.510
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:34.760
Character Transformation: Beat Jumper!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.480
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.460
Precisely as we planned.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.820
My heart: Unlock.

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:13.820
Character Transformation: Death Rebel.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.910
Please don't do this, Ikuto!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:27.680
Let's go!

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:30.750
Wait. It might be a trap.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.420
But we can't just leave them like this!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:36.450
Not Ikuto or the others!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.420
Yeah-nya! I won't give up either-nya!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:41.570
I'm gonna save Ikuto, no matter what-nya!

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:42.200
Amu-chan!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:42.790
Tadase!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.580
We should go, too.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.670
Yeah!

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.090
It really is a trap?

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:58.960
Be careful Amu-chan, Hotori-kun.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.810
Ikuto, remember me-nya!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:14.580
Give me the real Ikuto back-nya!

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.990
Yoru!

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:32.130
He's completely under their control!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:36.170
Tsukiyomi Ikuto! Have you lost even your heart?!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:41.050
No way-nya! The second that happened, I'd be gone-nya!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:44.710
I'm getting my Ikuto back, no matter what-nya!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.300
Stop here.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:55.730
We must ensure that those brats will continue to be of use to us.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:06.150
I can't move my body...

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.670
The Dumpty Key!

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:23.350
I believed in you... I always did... But after that day...

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.730
If you do still have a heart, please talk to me!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.270
Why would you do something like that?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.990
Ikuto-niisan!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.920
Ikuto!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:54.400
I believe Ikuto will return to normal.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.100
Amu-chan...

00:19:56.100 --> 00:20:00.010
Let's do what we can for now.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:04.740
We'll protect everyone's hearts' eggs. That's the Guardians' job!

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:13.650
Platinum Heart!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.380
The X Eggs are being purified!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.420
The Embryo's here!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.810
The Embryo!

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:51.430
Activate the Embryo Catcher!

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:52.640
Right!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.780
Amu-chan!

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.260
We missed it.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.250
Damn brats.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:29.190
Tadase-kun...

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:34.390
What exactly happened between you and Ikuto?

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:37.730
I'll tell you...

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:43.850
of the strange fate that binds me to Ikuto.

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:50.890
All the pieces have been put into place.

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:56.130
The next plan will be the last, and the greatest.

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:01.420
And it will, without a doubt, deliver the Embryo to you, Boss.

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:05.500
Can I trust those words?

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:08.760
Of course. This time, it's certain.

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:10.520
So be it.

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:13.270
I expect good results.

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:14.820
Sir.

00:22:27.870 --> 00:22:33.220
You sure do seem determined.

00:22:34.630 --> 00:22:39.270
So even if you screw up, it'll somehow turn out all right.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:46.640
How about you just trust in yourself?

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.100
Take that first step and everything will work out fine.

00:22:53.710 --> 00:23:00.030
Even if people see through your cool exterior, keep marching on.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:09.110
Look up at the blue sky and everything will reset!

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.750
Take it easy! Take it easy!

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:23.290
Try to relax those shoulders and clear your mind.

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:30.000
The more you do it, the easier it'll get, so keep taking it easy.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:35.200
Ride the flow of time and you'll be...

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.000
Shining! Shining! Shining!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:53.130
That's right. People have pasts!

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:55.230
What's with you, Miki?

00:23:55.230 --> 00:23:56.730
That sounds distressing.

00:23:56.730 --> 00:23:58.520
I was just thinking that if we knew their past,

00:23:58.520 --> 00:24:03.340
we might understand the pain Tadase-kun and Ikuto share.

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:05.010
That's true.

00:24:05.010 --> 00:24:09.820
Tell me, Tadase-kun. What happened between you two?

00:24:09.820 --> 00:24:12.160
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.160 --> 00:24:14.970
Tadase and Ikuto, The Horoscope of Fate!

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:18.250
And in case you were wondering, I used to be an egg!

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:19.630
Everyone knew that.
